    <h1>Ellsworth, ME Dispensary Guide</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Curaleaf, Maine Organic Therapy & the Downeast cannabis gateway to Acadia</p>
  </div>

  <section class="fact-box">
    <h2>Ellsworth Cannabis Quick Facts</h2>
    <table aria-label="Ellsworth cannabis market overview">
